1
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,039
Is this how you treat the person

2
00:01:11,039 --> 00:01:12,170
who saved your life?

3
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:13,370
Not even a thank you?

4
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,700
I didn't ask you to save me.

5
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,480
If you won't drink it, I will.

6
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,320
Only when you're full

7
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:33,759
do you have the strength

8
00:01:33,759 --> 00:01:35,560
to face the world's challenges.

9
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,200
Haven't you disliked eggs

10
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,479
since you were little?

11
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,080
Who would eat this

12
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,080
if they could get

13
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,160
something high in calories?

14
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:57,960
What am I going to do with you?

15
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:58,880
I told you not to run off,

16
00:01:58,880 --> 00:01:59,940
but you just had to.

17
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,520
Are you trying to get yourself killed,

18
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:02,520
or me?

19
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,560
When did you get this?

20
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,440
From a heartless woman.

21
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,810
It's none of your business.

22
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,010
You're a terrible swimmer.

23
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,960
Why risk your life to save me?

24
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,730
Your leg is perfectly fine.

25
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,570
Why pretend to be crippled?

26
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,800
What are you talking about?

27
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,920
I don't understand.

28
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,650
Drop the act.

29
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,920
You staged the poisoning

30
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,400
and the fall into the lake.

31
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,480
A scheme to fake your death,

32
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:38,960
right?

33
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,320
When did you find out?

34
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,660
I'm just worried it's too dangerous.

35
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:50,280
If I just run away from the wedding,

36
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,120
it will implicate the whole Xue family.

37
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,200
But only if I die

38
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,610
will Ning Yuanci

39
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,520
spare my father and the others.

40
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,360
The fake death potion
we prepared last time

41
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,520
was accidentally knocked over
by Xue Keying.

42
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,120
This time,

43
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,440
there can't be any mistakes.

44
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,120
I've lost count of

45
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:05,920
how many times I've filmed

46
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,120
this drowning scene.

47
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,340
How could I not know

48
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,720
if it's true or false?

49
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:15,240
Don't think I'll obey your every word

50
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:17,000
just because you have leverage over me.

51
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,520
I risked my life to save you,

52
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,250
and you still don't believe me?

53
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,360
Now,

54
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:22,360
our fates

55
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,420
are tied together.

56
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:24,720
If you die,

57
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,890
I won't survive either.

58
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,120
I am not like you,

59
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,240
blessed with a birth mother's protection

60
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,480
and a father's love.

61
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,880
I faked my limp only to

62
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,440
avoid complex struggles

63
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:46,000
and live in peace.

64
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:47,740
But His Majesty

65
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:50,040
insisted on betrothing me to Ning Yuanci.

66
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:51,300
What choice did I have?

67
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,280
To live,

68
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,360
I had to die.

69
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:56,680
Only death

70
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,620
could offer an escape.

71
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,000
But have you ever thought

72
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,640
that if something goes wrong,

73
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,770
you would truly die?

74
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:07,980
Is there any other way?

75
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,100
Should I break the engagement

76
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,600
and drag down the entire Xue family?

77
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,170
Listen to me.

78
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:16,839
Do not use such extreme methods

79
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:17,959
to solve the problem.

80
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,360
I will help you find a way.

81
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,880
Your way

82
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,220
is nothing but pestering Ning Yuanci

83
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,880
until he marries you.

84
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,160
Yes, yes.

85
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,160
Ning Yuanci is the most charming man

86
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,600
in the world.

87
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,080
Such a fine man,

88
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,680
I must win him over myself.

89
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,860
I don't need anyone to yield him to me.

90
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:38,800
Trust me.

91
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,840
I will do everything I can

92
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:43,450
to make him agree to break the engagement.

93
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,400
If you don't believe me,

94
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,720
I will tell your parents

95
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,920
about your fake limp.

96
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,400
I heard you were on duty

97
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,130
in the backyard last night.

98
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,600
Did anyone see how Xue Ruowan

99
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,000
fell into the water?

100
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:16,720
I was originally going to

101
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,560
deliver calming tea to the Eldest Miss,

102
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,520
but when I arrived,

103
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:21,120
she was no longer in her room.

104
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,640
I was steaming jujube cakes,

105
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:27,370
which are the young ladies' favorite.

106
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,320
I have been guarding the stove

107
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,120
and watching the fire the whole time.

108
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:33,120
You are Xue Ruowan's personal maid.

109
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,800
So you were by her side

110
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,920
when she fell into the water.

111
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,300
Therefore,

112
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:45,120
you are the prime suspect.

113
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,600
That can't be.

114
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,220
Lan is a loyal servant.

115
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,480
It was the Second Miss who pushed her.

116
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,720
I saw it with my own eyes.

117
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,280
What?

118
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,440
I helped you,

119
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,520
and you bite the hand that feeds you.

120
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,480
You wretched girl,

121
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,600
how dare you frame my Ying'er!

122
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,800
I'll tear your mouth apart!

123
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,960
The Eldest Miss and the Second Miss

124
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,840
have never gotten along.

125
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,120
Recently, because of
the Eldest Miss's marriage

126
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,200
to the General,

127
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,640
she has been threatening
and making things difficult for her.

128
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,800
The Second Miss even

129
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:05,800
put down the bamboo pole early.

130
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,680
This is clearly kicking her
while she's down.

131
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:09,720
I prepared the bamboo pole to save her.

132
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,640
How did you know

133
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,860
she would fall into the water?

134
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:14,560
I...

135
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:20,780
If I tell them
I transmigrated into a script,

136
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,320
they'll think I'm crazy.

137
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,800
If I spoil the fact that Xue Ruowan

138
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,360
orchestrated this,

139
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,560
Ning Yuanci definitely won't let her off.

140
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,490
What should I do?

141
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,440
I prepared the bamboo pole

142
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:33,240
because my sister has weak legs.

143
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:34,200
Just in case one day,

144
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,720
she accidentally falls in,

145
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,720
we'd be prepared.

146
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,040
Besides,

147
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,760
I went in to save her myself.

148
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,920
How could I be the one who harmed her?

149
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,360
That makes sense.

150
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,520
You were with me the whole time

151
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,560
before she fell in last night.

152
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,040
So,

153
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:52,690
it definitely couldn't have been you
who pushed her.

154
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:54,920
A man

155
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:58,480
and a woman alone late at night.

156
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,080
Shouldn't the General

157
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,040
give our Ying'er

158
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,330
an explanation?

159
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,090
Ying'er,

160
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,210
what exactly happened?

161
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,170
It's not what you think.

162
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,920
We just

163
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:14,120
bumped into each other
in the back garden last night.

164
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,600
Right?

165
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,560
The Second Lady yesterday

166
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,440
specifically asked me out.

167
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,480
She kept pestering me,

168
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:22,600
saying

169
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,180
she wouldn't marry anyone but me.

170
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:26,720
I had no choice but

171
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,520
to reject her.

172
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,560
When did I ever

173
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,960
say I wanted to marry you?

174
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:32,890
Ying'er,

175
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,800
don't you always say

176
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:35,840
you'll only

177
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,440
marry Ning Yuanci in this life?

178
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:39,960
I didn't.

179
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:41,159
I'm not.

180
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,760
Whoever says that again is a dog.

181
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,320
Mother understands you.

182
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,060
You're just

183
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,080
being shy.

184
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,480
I really didn't mean that.

185
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,000
This matter ends here.

186
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,370
Ultimately,

187
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,760
it is just a minor conflict

188
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,159
between the two sisters.

189
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,200
If anyone dares to breathe a word of this

190
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:00,920
and ruin the young ladies' reputations,

191
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,200
I will break your legs.

192
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,600
Yes.

193
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:06,840
Is anyone even

194
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:08,200
listening to me?

195
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:10,680
General!

196
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,160
The whole city knows

197
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:15,220
about your marriage to my Xue family.

198
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,600
Your wedding with Wan'er

199
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,600
has been postponed again and again.

200
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:22,010
You have to give me an explanation.

201
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,040
What kind of explanation do you want,

202
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,320
Duke?

203
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,880
I want the General

204
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,680
to hold an engagement banquet

205
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,159
at Jinming Pool.

206
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:36,240
It will be a good explanation
to the public.

207
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,039
I'm also doing this

208
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:39,440
for the sake of my daughters' reputations.

209
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,799
I beg the General

210
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,760
to agree to my request.

211
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,570
Ning Yuanci.

212
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,080
Why did you exaggerate?

213
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,540
Saying I'm pestering you?

214
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:13,280
I was just trying to help you
out of kindness.

215
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:13,920
But you,

216
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,680
you're really unpopular in the residence.

217
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,880
Are you that popular?

218
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:20,140
Even ghosts would stay away from you.

219
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,560
You clearly know who the real culprit is

220
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:25,880
regarding Xue Ruowan
jumping into the lake.

221
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,540
Why didn't you tell the truth?

222
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:28,800
Who knows?

223
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,130
I don't know.

224
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,280
When people lie,

225
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:39,040
their pulse quickens.

226
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:40,480
What exactly

227
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,380
are you hiding for Xue Ruowan?

228
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,000
Or is there something
about your Xue family...

229
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,330
an unspeakable secret.

230
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,200
You know

231
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,800
Xue Ruowan doesn't like you.

232
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,760
Why don't you break the engagement

233
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:51,960
instead of forcing her to marry you?

234
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,560
Are you

235
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:53,880
plotting something?

236
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,480
My plot is

237
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:07,440
to marry both of you.

238
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:10,330
The three of us will live together.

239
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,660
Take care. I won't see you out.

240
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,800
What are you thinking about, General?

241
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,040
Xue Keying used to obey

242
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:36,880
my every word.

243
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,800
It's really strange

244
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:40,000
that she suddenly drew a line with me.

245
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:40,480
And

246
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:42,010
Xue Shiyan's attitude.

247
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,320
He seems very eager

248
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,920
to marry Xue Ruowan off to me.

249
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:46,440
Do you suspect

250
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,580
he has an ulterior motive?

251
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,320
Last time,

252
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,000
the assassin who attacked Xue Ruowan

253
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,530
used the same sword as mine.

254
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:53,680
And

255
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,160
the hidden weapon used

256
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:56,560
is also commonly used

257
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,640
by Northern spies.

258
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:59,570
Do you think this is a coincidence?

259
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,160
But except for the inner quarters
of the Duke's estate,

260
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,360
which haven't been searched,

261
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,400
I have investigated every corner

262
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,120
inside and outside

263
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,380
the other courtyards.

264
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,200
I found nothing suspicious.

265
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:11,120
Xue Shiyan offered

266
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:13,760
to hold the engagement banquet
at Jinming Pool.

267
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:15,160
Then let him have his way.

268
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:16,760
I'd like to see

269
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:18,320
who dares to play tricks

270
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:20,040
right under my nose.
